ORIGIN
======

Material Eleven for Android is a from-scratch rewrite of Material-Eleven, the
PS Vita music player (https://github.com/Perroabuelo/Material-Eleven,
GNU GPL version 3 or later). No C code from the Vita version is included.

  Derived parts:
  - The cover-art accent colour algorithm (core/accent) is a Kotlin
    translation of source/accent.c from Material-Eleven, by the same author,
    under the same licence.
  - The colour palette and visual design follow Material-Eleven.


